WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:14.381
NARRATOR: Sebae is on a
mission to find his sister.

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:24.357
Without her help, Sebae will
struggle to keep her cubs alive

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:25.925
and may never rule again.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:33.133
It's a hazardous journey
for the tiny youngsters.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.374
Giants loom.

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:54.454
The mercury bubbles, and
danger lurks in every shadow.

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:03.329
They must stay close.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.883
At last, a familiar
scent on the breeze.

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:29.255
[soft roar]

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:55.882
NARRATOR: Sebae's calls
go unanswered, leaving

00:01:55.949 --> 00:02:00.253
a single terrifying question.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.155
Is your sister still alive?

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:31.351
Filled with dread, Sebae fears
the worst for her sister,

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:35.455
but a tantalizing
scent lures Sebae on.

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:50.837
The cubs battle exhaustion
as their little legs struggle

00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:51.638
to keep up.

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:28.942
Finally, the familiar call
she's been hoping to hear.

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:30.777
[soft roaring]

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:42.522
NARRATOR: Her beloved
sister safe and sound.

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:07.814
And she has cubs.

00:04:25.732 --> 00:04:37.677
Two sisters, one family,
reunited at last.

00:04:37.744 --> 00:04:44.684
Stronger together and
ready to build an empire.

